        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix: clean up iOS About page copy",
        "body": "Closes #98943\r\n\r\n## What Problem This Solves\r\n\r\nFixes an issue where users opening Settings > About would see redundant and low-value device details, including a repeated OpenClaw summary row, generic `Device` text, a `Platform` label that duplicated `iOS`, and a `Model` row that exposed a hardware identifier with little user-facing value.\r\n\r\n## Why This Change Was Made\r\n\r\nThe About page now shows a shorter public-facing summary: OpenClaw app version, resolved iPhone/iPad model name, and iOS version. Diagnostics remains unchanged so lower-level device family, platform, and model identifier details are still available where they belong.\r\n\r\n## User Impact\r\n\r\nUsers now see a cleaner About page with clearer labels and a useful device model name, such as `iPhone 17 Pro` or `iPad Pro 13-inch (M5)`, instead of generic or redundant system text.\r\n\r\n## Evidence\r\n\r\nFocused verification:\r\n- `xcodebuild test -project apps/ios/OpenClaw.xcodeproj -scheme OpenClaw -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17 Pro' -only-testing:OpenClawTests/DeviceInfoHelperTests`\r\n- `xcodebuild test -project apps/ios/OpenClaw.xcodeproj -scheme OpenClaw -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17 Pro' '-only-testing:OpenClawTests/RootTabsSourceGuardTests/settings about page shows concise public device details'`\r\n- `xcodebuild test -project apps/ios/OpenClaw.xcodeproj -scheme OpenClawLogicTests -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17 Pro'`\r\n\r\n### iPhone About\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n| --- | --- |\r\n| <img width=\"260\" alt=\"iphone-about-before\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/00b4eb7d-0a78-4468-a83c-fa5fa7ad455e\" /> | <img width=\"260\" alt=\"iphone-about-after\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e9845d50-26d6-4765-bad5-50a513e5d36b\" /> |\r\n\r\n### iPad About\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n| --- | --- |\r\n| <img width=\"300\" alt=\"ipad-about-before\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/59b987a9-62d4-4330-806f-22b547091aa8\" /> | <img width=\"300\" alt=\"ipad-about-after\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/26ef1496-381b-4f15-a4b7-66edeb963f84\" /> |\r\n\r\nNotes:\r\n- `git diff --check` passed.\r\n- Codex/autoreview passed after removing unrelated SwiftPM lockfile churn.\r\n- The broader `OpenClawTests` scheme still has two unrelated existing source-guard failures outside this change.",
